-fa","text":"No, thank you.","start":56.29,"end":57.55,"score":0.951,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b1-049-015","sourceId":"b1-049-015","sourceIndex":14,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,9],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"My husband likes steak, but he doesn't like chicken.","start":58.62,"end":63.28,"score":0.923,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b1-049-016","sourceId":"b1-049-016","sourceIndex":15,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,12],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"To tell you the truth, Mrs. Bird, I don't like chicken either!","start":64.56,"end":69.14,"score":0.902,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]}]}
